		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3504AC546284B5BC"]
			description: ["The &6Data Bank&r stores every orb and stick of research in one hall. Computer casings, and the same computer racks the research station will want. Research, and the saved patterns that ZPM and later machines ask for. Let ME carry orbs in and out so you never swap them by hand."]
			icon: "gtceu:data_bank"
