		}
		{
			dependencies: ["13A62146F4473640"]
			description: ["The &6Research Station&r reads a data stick or orb, runs the array on it and writes the research back. The array behind it, the data bank for storage, and a research item to read. The first ZPM research: the hatch that opens the next era. Feed orbs by ME and let the bank file them."]
