		}
		{
			dependencies: ["113C8087627608BC"]
			description: ["The first orb worth writing is the ZPM energy hatch's research. The large mixer on two LuV hatches for the wiring, and the europium that went into the station's ZPM motors. The ZPM energy hatch, and so the gate to the next era. Copy orbs rather than rewriting them; the station keeps the original."]
			icon: "gtceu:data_orb"
